# Python and Django Rules

- Use `.agents/skills/python-patterns/`, `.agents/skills/python-testing/`, `.agents/skills/django-patterns/`, `.agents/skills/django-security/`, and `.agents/skills/django-verification/` when relevant.
- Respect plugin boundaries: plugins depend on `omero_plugin_common`, never on each other.
- Verify host `ruff` matches the repo-pinned version before claiming local verification.
- Run split `pytest` suites separately with `-p no:cacheprovider -W error`.
- For security-sensitive edits, follow the mandatory read order in `AGENTS.md`.
